    <published>2026-08-25T00:00:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-08-25T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
    <summary>基于IPv6的免费屏幕共享工具。多人实时屏幕共享与远程控制工具。共享端无需安装任何客户端，观看端只需一个浏览器，打开网址即可加入观看。</summary>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="哔哩哔哩">哔哩哔哩<a class="anchor" href="https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/posts/teartcshare/#%E5%93%94%E5%93%A9%E5%93%94%E5%93%A9"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore="true">#</span></a></h2><p>基于IPv6的免费屏幕共享工具。多人实时屏幕共享与远程控制工具，包含一起听功能。共享端无需安装任何客户端，观看端只需一个浏览器，打开网址即可加入观看。</p><hr /><figure class="markdown-image-figure"> <img src="https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/_astro/TeaRTC%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA.MGIjkY6l_jlzWT.webp" srcset="https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/_astro/TeaRTC%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA.MGIjkY6l_28vuSm.webp 640w, https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/_astro/TeaRTC%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA.MGIjkY6l_q1PB7.webp 750w, https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/_astro/TeaRTC%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA.MGIjkY6l_tHf7T.webp 828w, https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/_astro/TeaRTC%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA.MGIjkY6l_Z2s6iKc.webp 1080w, https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/_astro/TeaRTC%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA.MGIjkY6l_1Ppn2p.webp 1280w, https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/_astro/TeaRTC%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA.MGIjkY6l_qciiu.webp 1668w, https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/_astro/TeaRTC%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA.MGIjkY6l_Z1Qx6YM.webp 2048w, https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/_astro/TeaRTC%E5%B1%8F%E5%B9%95%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA.MGIjkY6l_jlzWT.webp 2556w" alt="界面展示" title="界面展示" loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 2556px) 2556px, 100vw" data-astro-image="constrained" data-astro-image-fit="cover" data-astro-image-pos="center" width="2556" height="1469" /><figcaption class="markdown-image-caption">界面展示</figcaption></figure><hr /><section class="markdown-section"><h3 id="注意">注意：<a class="anchor" href="https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/posts/teartcshare/#%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore="true">#</span></a></h3><ul>
<li>需双方都具有IPv6
<blockquote>
<div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame" data-language="PowerShell"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="PowerShell" class="wrap" style="--ecMaxLine:57ch"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8"># 管理员模式运行 PowerShell 开启 IPv6 命令</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">2</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8">Enable-NetAdapterBinding -Name "*" -ComponentID ms_tcpip6</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div>
</blockquote>
</li>
<li>需安装服务端的“CA证书”才可正常共享自己的视频、音频流
<blockquote>
<p>进入服务页面后，点击顶部“安全（盾牌）”进行安装</p>
</blockquote>
</li>
</ul></section><section class="markdown-section"><h3 id="frpfrp域名访问无需ipv6">FRP：<code>FRP域名访问无需IPv6</code><a class="anchor" href="https://teaclearinkii.pages.dev/posts/teartcshare/#frpfrp%E5%9F%9F%E5%90%8D%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80ipv6"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore="true">#</span></a></h3><ul>
<li>使用FRP软件将本地服务映射到公网可便于朋友长期使用半固定域名地址访问服务
<blockquote>
<p>FRP可能有带宽限制，延迟可能更高。因此当用户使用域名进行访问时将会自动提示建议用户切换为IPv6直连</p>
</blockquote>
</li>
</ul><p><a href="https://github.com/TeaClearInkII/TeaRTC-Share/blob/master/README.md" data-content-link-kind="external" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">详细说明</a></p><hr /><p>QQ群：<a href="https://qm.qq.com/q/NRMQ0B9kyG" data-content-link-kind="external" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">219414173</a></p></section></section>
